        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This fixes:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1.  the importer didn't actually do anything with the source flag",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2.  the importer didn't stop when it got 500 exceptions from fedora",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "3.  the importer tried to import to URLs that didn't match the subject URIs in the export files",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
