     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/34\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/34</a></p>\n\n<p>This fixes:</p>\n\n<p>1.  the importer didn't actually do anything with the source flag<br/>\n2.  the importer didn't stop when it got 500 exceptions from fedora<br/>\n3.  the importer tried to import to URLs that didn't match the subject URIs in the export files</p>",
